<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cochlear year net profit A$10.86 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cochlear year net profit A$10.86 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				     10.86</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    12.50</p>
<p>NOTE: Cochlear Ltd is a bionic ear manufacturer and was previously owned by conglomerate Pacific Dunlop Ltd. This is the company's first full year result since listing on the Australian Stock Exchange on December 4, 1995.</p>
</text>
